{
  "$defs": {
    "PolicyBinding": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对一份版本化规则的绑定：`policy_id` + SemVer + 内容哈希（03-data.md §7.3）。\n\n`role` 区分 availability policy、precedence policy、PIT 选择规则与 parser 版本；使用处按字段\n要求确切的 `role`，因此 availability 与 precedence 绑定不能互相冒充。\n\n**诚实边界**：只约束形状。该版本是否已登记、`policy_hash` 是否等于该版本的真实内容、\npolicy 是否带有已审阅的来源证据，属未来 Registry（03-data.md §7.3「标识符冻结 ≠ 数据可信」）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyRole"
        },
        "policy_id": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
          "title": "Policy Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "policy_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Policy Hash",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "role",
        "policy_id",
        "version",
        "policy_hash"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyBinding",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PolicyRole": {
      "description": "一条绑定所约束的规则类别；同一形状的绑定按类别分别使用、不可互换。",
      "enum": [
        "availability",
        "precedence",
        "point_in_time",
        "parser"
      ],
      "title": "PolicyRole",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次 PIT 查询的全部输入（ADR-0023 §5，03-data.md §7.5）。\n\n- `name` + `version`：本 spec 自身的身份；manifest 以 `name + SemVer + content_hash()`\n  绑定它（批次 B2）；\n- simulation：单点 `simulation_time`，**或** UTC 半开区间\n  `[simulation_start, simulation_end)`，二选一，区间两端必须同时给出且\n  `simulation_start < simulation_end`；\n- `knowledge_cutoff`：本机知识截止，与 simulation 独立（历史 backfill 时通常晚于 simulation）；\n- `snapshot_bindings`：读取的每张 Iceberg 表 `namespace.table → snapshot_id`，至少一项；\n- PIT 选择规则、availability policy、precedence policy、parser 版本的绑定，各自 `role` 确切、\n  同一字段内 `policy_id` 不得重复（同一 policy 两个版本即不确定），按 `policy_id` 规范排序。\n\nuniverse 绑定（ADR-0024）与 manifest 属批次 B2，不在本模型内。**诚实边界**：绑定能否解析到\n已登记且带证据的版本、snapshot 是否存在、所需表是否齐全，属未来执行器与 Registry\n（03-data.md §7.5 fail closed）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.2.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "name": {
      "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*(?:\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)*$",
      "title": "Name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "version": {
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "simulation_time": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Simulation Time"
    },
    "simulation_start": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Simulation Start"
    },
    "simulation_end": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Simulation End"
    },
    "knowledge_cutoff": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Knowledge Cutoff",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "snapshot_bindings": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "minProperties": 1,
      "patternProperties": {
        "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "title": "Snapshot Bindings",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "point_in_time_binding": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
    },
    "availability_bindings": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Availability Bindings",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "precedence_bindings": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Precedence Bindings",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "parser_bindings": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PolicyBinding"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Parser Bindings",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "name",
    "version",
    "knowledge_cutoff",
    "snapshot_bindings",
    "point_in_time_binding",
    "availability_bindings",
    "precedence_bindings",
    "parser_bindings"
  ],
  "title": "PointInTimeSpec",
  "type": "object"
}
